# OpenSIM — Environment variables (template)
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE only. Real values live in `.env` (git-ignored).
# `justfile` sets `dotenv-load := true`, so this file MUST exist in the
# working tree (even if empty) to avoid a `just` warning on every recipe
# parse. See https://just.systems/man/en/environment.html for the
# `dotenv-load` setting.
#
# OpenSIM's runtime env surface is tiny — most configuration is read
# from the Cloudflare D1 binding `env.DB` at request time, not from
# host env vars. The vars below are only consumed by:
#   1. `drizzle.config.ts` (CF_ACCOUNT_ID / CF_DATABASE_ID / CF_D1_TOKEN)
#      — only required for remote D1 ops (`just db-migrate-remote`,
#      `just db-seed-remote`); local D1 via Miniflare ignores them.
#   2. `src/lib/server/db/seed-password.ts` (OPENSIM_TEST_*) — overrides
#      for the dev credential provisioner; defaults exist for all.
#   3. CI flag (CI) — set by `just ci` for e2e retry behavior.
#
# Example values below are placeholders. Copy this file to `.env` and
# edit as needed. The `.env` file is git-ignored.

# CF_ACCOUNT_ID (required for remote D1 ops)
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=your_cloudflare_account_id

# CF_DATABASE_ID (required for remote D1 ops)
# CF_DATABASE_ID=your_d1_database_id

# CF_D1_TOKEN (required for remote D1 ops; alternative to wrangler login)
# CF_D1_TOKEN=your_cloudflare_api_token

# OPENSIM_TEST_CONTROL_NUMBER (dev credential override)
# OPENSIM_TEST_CONTROL_NUMBER=<NUMERO DE CONTROL PURGADO>

# OPENSIM_TEST_PASSWORD (dev credential override)
# OPENSIM_TEST_PASSWORD=opensim-dev-2026

# OPENSIM_TEST_FULL_NAME (dev credential override)
# OPENSIM_TEST_FULL_NAME=Test Student

# OPENSIM_TEST_CURP (dev credential override)
# OPENSIM_TEST_CURP=TEST000000HDFXXX00

# CI (set to "true" inside `just ci` for e2e retry behavior)
# CI=false
